  "details": "Some translations strings for control buttons under camera pickup still not fit.\n\nPic related.\n\nPlease note that button for photo resolution is already well-configured and looks good. I believe that text field configuration can be used on other buttons.\n\nIn this exact case we used explicit line breaks in the translations strings, but without them it's roughly the same tiny font size, just being in single line.\n\nIt would be great if all buttons had support for two lines of text.",
